  "summaries": {
    "en": "Pikmin type optimisation, Dandori efficiency, and night expedition survival strategies for a complete Pikmin 4 playthrough.",
    "ja": "ピクミン種最適化、ダンドリ効率化、夜の探索サバイバル戦略を解説するピクミン4完全攻略ガイド。"
  },
  "category": "strategy",
